                    <note type="editorial"><p>    In 1825 there are two encounters - one with West Junr in the company of J Taylor (who had known <persName key="WES04">Benjamin West</persName>)
    and one where West is linked to <persName key="NOR01">Northcote</persName> and Sully. Both suggest West's son, Raphael Lamar West (1766–1850), history painter .   
    A third entry in 1828, linking West to <persName key="HOF01">Hofland</persName> and <persName key="UWI02"/> (both painters) has been coded for Raphael West.
    Other entries for West  have been coded as <persName key="WES06">Thomas West</persName>.</p>
    
    See his father, Benjamin West, in <title>DNB</title>.
